meta {
  name: 06a Export Aufgaben (NDJSON)
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/hellodata/v1/ndjson/aufgaben
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/x-ndjson
}

tests {
  test("response is NDJSON", function() {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.getHeader("content-type")).to.contain("application/x-ndjson");
  });

  test("last line is the _meta sentinel line", function() {
    // Without this line the stream was truncated and the load counts as failed -
    // after HTTP 200 no error can be reported any more.
    // Bruno parses the body when it happens to be valid JSON - which it is whenever the
    // export contains a single line - so normalise back to text before splitting.
    const body = res.getBody();
    const raw = typeof body === "string" ? body : JSON.stringify(body);
    const lines = raw.split("\n").filter(l => l.trim() !== "");
    const meta = JSON.parse(lines[lines.length - 1])._meta;

    expect(meta).to.not.equal(undefined);
    expect(meta.status).to.equal("complete");
    expect(meta.rowCount).to.equal(lines.length - 1);
  });
}

docs {
  Returns all Aufgaben as NDJSON: one JSON object per line,
  terminated by a `_meta` line.

  Each row carries the Aufgabe id, the AufgabeStatus, the Faelligkeitsdatum
  (`faelligBis`), the foreign keys to the erfassender (`userErfasst`) and the
  verantwortlicher Benutzer (`empfaenger`), the optional foreign keys to Kind
  (`kindId`) and Anlass (`anlassId`) and the assigned Labels as a comma-separated
  list of Label UUIDs. Titel, Bemerkung, the file attachments and the Link are never
  exported (free text / internal deep link, may contain personal data).

  Aufgaben are not tenant-scoped in the database, but the BE-only access gate applies,
  so `baseUrl` must point at the BE host.

  Checking that streaming works (Bruno buffers the response, hence curl):

      curl -N -w '\nstart=%{time_starttransfer}s total=%{time_total}s\n' \
        -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" \
        -H "Accept: application/x-ndjson" \
        https://local-esc-be.localhost:6443/api/hellodata/v1/ndjson/aufgaben

  If `time_starttransfer` is well below `time_total`, the cursor is live.
  If both values are nearly equal, pgjdbc buffered the whole result set -
  then the transaction boundary is wrong.
}
